	(text "Bread Modular 4mix channel on +/-12 V: jack -> 10u -> 100k -> inverting buffer (100k || 20p, gain -1) -> 100R -> VOL (CW = pin 3).\nVOL wiper -> 100k -> MAIN_SUM. A unity follower buffers the wiper (post-fader) and drives SEND A / SEND B through 100R;\neach send wiper -> 100k -> SENDA_SUM / SENDB_SUM. Audio only: AC-coupled (10u into 100k, -3 dB at 0.16 Hz), 100k input\nimpedance at any knob position; TN grounds an unpatched input. Full CW = unity gain (the root summers invert again, so MAIN/SEND outputs keep the input polarity)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "67adea7d-bd68-5740-b2f0-4e5aa9893b28")
	)
	(text "Taper: each wiper sees 100k to a virtual ground (as Bread Modular 4mix/imix), so the 50k B pots run slightly\nbelow linear (about 44 % at mid rotation)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6eb3f388-0e64-5657-a22d-a1075bba35c5")
	)
	(text "CHANNEL STRIP (one sheet, used 4 times: CH1..CH4; parts n01.. per channel)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d75a88dd-2e91-578e-87b8-2d37da17d664")
	)
